[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  # Lab 4 — Wheelhouse: The Application Exists

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  **Monday, August 31** · Covers Class 4 · Learning Outcome 3

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  ## Objective

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  Last week you produced a specification. Today Wheelhouse becomes an application: a Rails 8 project on
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  PostgreSQL, styled with Bootstrap, serving the four public pages of the shop.

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  No tables are created today and no model is written — your Lab 3 diagram becomes a schema in Lab 5.
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  This lab is the frame the rest of the semester is built inside.

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  ## Before you start

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  All of this must be installed and working **before** the session. None of it is part of the lab, and
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  an installation problem discovered at 12:30 costs you the afternoon.

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  - **Ruby 4.0.4** and **Rails 8.0**. Check with `ruby -v` and `rails -v`.
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  - **Node 26.1.0** and **npm**, which comes with it. Node is not here for your JavaScript — importmap
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m    handles that with no build step. It is here to compile Bootstrap's Sass, and without it `rails new`
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m    fails partway through.
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  - **PostgreSQL running locally**, and a role that can create databases. Connect to it from a terminal
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m    before you write a line of Rails.
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  - Your `webtech-wheelhouse` repository from Lab 3, cloned on the machine you bring.

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  ## The deliverable

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  **The same repository as Lab 3.** `webtech-wheelhouse` keeps the URL you submitted last week and the
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  commits that are already in it: at the end of today its history is your Lab 3 work followed by today's.
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  Creating a second repository, or emptying this one and pushing the application as a fresh start, does
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  not meet this requirement.

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  **One repository, not two.** There is exactly one `.git` directory, the one that was already there.
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  If you find a second one inside a folder Rails created, you have the application in the wrong place.

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  **The application at the root.** `Gemfile`, `app/`, `config/` and everything else Rails writes sit
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  beside the `docs/` directory from Lab 3, which stays exactly where it is. Nothing goes in a
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  subdirectory: whoever clones the repository is at the application the moment the clone finishes.

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  Two files that already exist in your repository also come with Rails, and only one of them matters:

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  - `README.md`. Keep either version — what is graded is that the final one meets requirement 7.
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  - `.gitignore`. **This one matters.** The repository must end up with Rails's entries in it, whether
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m    you take its file whole or merge it into yours. Leaving your Lab 3 file untouched does not meet
[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m    requirement 8.

[34m[49m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[1m[24m[22m[1m[23m  **Canvas.** Submit the URL of your repository. This lab is **individual**.

